{"4271520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Pines", "steam_appid": 4271520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/d77f4193135e36ec9f6e4d1b975bf007.avif?t=1780906358\" width=1560 height=462 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dense open world filled with secrets, hidden locations, and stories to uncover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape Edward Walker through character progression and meaningful choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep skill and perk system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover side stories and rumors that reveal the truth behind The Pines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate clues, connect stories, and decide who to trust</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid combat with a wide variety of weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique Stalker System that responds to your choices and actions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME HOME… MISTER WALKER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a case went cold, former detective Edward Walker is exhausted and desperate for peace. His therapist advises him to travel to The Pines, a secluded retreat that promises quiet, recovery, and therapists on site. It seems like the perfect place to leave his troubles behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It isn’t. Beneath its calm exterior, something is deeply wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/06d49a00d336202a6866cd22158892f7.poster.avif?t=1780906358\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/06d49a00d336202a6866cd22158892f7.webm?t=1780906358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/06d49a00d336202a6866cd22158892f7.mp4?t=1780906358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A PSYCHOLOGICAL HORROR RPG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pines is an open world waiting to be explored, but it is no vacation. Dark things lurk among the trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover its secrets, get to know its residents, and uncover the truth behind the retreat’s carefully constructed facade. Your choices matter. They shape not only Edward’s story, but also the lives and fates of those who live there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/2cc97744b980e3c2f482629289556d6f.poster.avif?t=1780906358\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/2cc97744b980e3c2f482629289556d6f.webm?t=1780906358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/2cc97744b980e3c2f482629289556d6f.mp4?t=1780906358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger, smarter, and more persuasive. Join various groups and factions, each with their own stories, and shape Edward Walker to fit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk, fight, or investigate your way through the dangers you face. <br>And if all else fails… run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAST AND FLUID COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While guns and ammunition are scarce, tools are plenty. Wield bats, axes, and many more weapons as you face the dangers hunting you from the dark. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, parry, and strike at the right moment. Survival depends on timing, awareness, and sometimes… something very sharp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/4928d735b445f995b42882652697cd12.poster.avif?t=1780906358\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/4928d735b445f995b42882652697cd12.webm?t=1780906358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/4928d735b445f995b42882652697cd12.mp4?t=1780906358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE RESIDENTS OF THE PINES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pines is home to a wide variety of residents from all walks of life, each carrying their own history, trauma, and secrets. What initially feels a warm and welcoming community gradually reveals itself to be something far more unsettling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has a story. Everyone has a motive. And no one is quite who they claim to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/5a57985d2cb989804cba02222264af39.poster.avif?t=1780906358\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/5a57985d2cb989804cba02222264af39.webm?t=1780906358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/5a57985d2cb989804cba02222264af39.mp4?t=1780906358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE BIG CONSPIRACY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing quite adds up. Minor details refuse to align, and the more you investigate, the harder it becomes to ignore the feeling that everything is connected. Edward Walker must uncover the truth behind The Pines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All while trying to stay sane… and alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/1f1eaf8592d0c734496a90b01fa9b85d.poster.avif?t=1780906358\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/1f1eaf8592d0c734496a90b01fa9b85d.webm?t=1780906358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/1f1eaf8592d0c734496a90b01fa9b85d.mp4?t=1780906358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONCE A DETECTIVE, ALWAYS A DETECTIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a former detective comes with its perks. You notice details others overlook, connect clues that don’t seem related, and uncover hidden truths through investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/e66251eebd33a444aa8d602413adcea5.poster.avif?t=1780906358\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/e66251eebd33a444aa8d602413adcea5.webm?t=1780906358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/e66251eebd33a444aa8d602413adcea5.mp4?t=1780906358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather evidence, piece together stories, and decide who to trust. Because a good decision is an informed one.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A UNIQUE STALKER SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pines uses a unique Stalker System where your actions have consequences. Say the wrong thing, cross the wrong person, or dig too deep, and a resident who once seemed harmless may return as a stalker, haunting you throughout the  forests of The Pines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/bbf279d02ed1d1e79ac245c670244348.poster.avif?t=1780906358\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/bbf279d02ed1d1e79ac245c670244348.webm?t=1780906358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/bbf279d02ed1d1e79ac245c670244348.mp4?t=1780906358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, however, are not defenseless. Grow strong enough, and you may be able to turn the tables and confront your pursuer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest remembers… and some residents never forget.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271520/extras/d77f4193135e36ec9f6e4d1b975bf007.avif?t=1780906358\" width=1560 height=462 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dense open world filled with secrets, hidde